sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as Election Officer / Admin
    participant UI as Admin Console
    participant Ctrl as Election Controller
    participant ElSvc as ElectionService
    participant CandRepo as CandidateRepository
    participant ElRepo as ElectionRepository
    participant DB as MariaDB / MySQL

    Note over Officer,DB: Lifecycle: Draft -> Scheduled -> Open -> Closed -> Results Published

    Officer->>UI: Request transition (e.g., Draft -> Open)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /admin/elections/status (id, targetStatus, CSRF)
    Ctrl->>ElSvc: transitionState(electionId, targetStatus, userId)
    
    ElSvc->>ElRepo: findById(electionId)
    ElRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM elections WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>ElRepo: Election record
    
    alt Target is 'open' or 'scheduled'
        ElSvc->>CandRepo: countApproved(electionId)
        CandRepo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM candidates WHERE election_id = ? AND approval_status = 'approved'
        DB-->>CandRepo: Candidate count
        
        alt Approved candidates < 2
            ElSvc-->>Ctrl: Rejection: At least 2 approved candidates required
            Ctrl-->>UI: Display candidate requirement warning
        else Closing time in past
            ElSvc-->>Ctrl: Rejection: Closing time must be in future
            Ctrl-->>UI: Display date error
        else Validation Passed
            ElSvc->>ElRepo: updateStatus(electionId, targetStatus)
            ElRepo->>DB: UPDATE elections SET status = ? WHERE id = ?
            ElSvc-->>Ctrl: Success
            Ctrl-->>UI: Status updated (Candidate & ballot configuration locked)
        end
    end
